[124.391472, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[124.43498, "o", "A prefix cache: ONE engine, empty at the start. Each full block is named by a SHA-256 hash of the block\r\nbefore it and its own tokens, so the same opening gives the same hashes.\r\nTime to first token comes from the lab's cost model: 20 ms + 2 ms per token NOT found in the cache.\r\n--salt: the gateway mixes a per-tenant salt into block 0, so each tenant gets its own hashes.\r\n\r\n"]
[124.435128, "o", "  acme   ...system prompt + \"where is my order\"  (21 tokens)\r\n          blocks 2475debe2f6b:miss f1a3cb93347d:miss 979834c0bab4:miss e427453a3640:miss 847aa536ad0a:miss\r\n          cached tokens  0   time to first token  62 ms\r\n"]
[124.435318, "o", "  acme   ...system prompt + \"reset my password\"  (20 tokens)\r\n          blocks 2475debe2f6b:HIT f1a3cb93347d:HIT 979834c0bab4:HIT e427453a3640:HIT 9973e85def84:miss\r\n          cached tokens 16   time to first token  28 ms   from acme's blocks\r\n  globex ...system prompt + \"what is the weather\"  (21 tokens)\r\n          blocks 3f4475590b1b:miss 216e75703440:miss 8c2950c46106:miss c7b20a1881f3:miss d452ffacfa96:miss\r\n          cached tokens  0   time to first token  62 ms\r\n\r\nglobex sent the same opening and got 0 cached tokens: no answer came back faster.\r\n"]
