[135.712156, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[135.766348, "o", "stacks/first-draft/docker-compose.yml: 5 containers (read only, nothing is started)\r\nA container = one program and the files it needs, run as an isolated process on this host.\r\n\r\n  service   image (name:version)                     ports                 who can reach it\r\n  ollama    ollama/ollama:0.1.33                     11434:11434           host port 11434: every host address (0.0.0.0, [::])\r\n  vllm      vllm/vllm-openai:v0.10.2                 8000:8000             host port 8000: every host address (0.0.0.0, [::])\r\n  triton    nvcr.io/nvidia/tritonserver:25.03-py3    8001:8001             host port 8001: every host address (0.0.0.0, [::])\r\n  ray-head  rayproject/ray:2.8.0                     8265:8265             host port 8265: every host address (0.0.0.0, [::])\r\n  gateway   tsg/inference-gateway:lab                443:8443              host port 443: every host address (0.0.0.0, [::])\r\n\r\n\"8000:8000\" = host port 8000 -> container port 8000 on every host address.\r\n\"127.0.0.1:8443:8443\" = the same, for this host only.  \"expose\" = no port on the host at all.\r\n"]
[135.773838, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;thesecguy@lab: ~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m26\u0007\u001b[01;32mthesecguy@lab\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m26\u001b[00m$ "]
